{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18809","headline":"和令狐相公晚泛汉江书怀寄洋州崔侍郎阆州高舍人二曹长 · 刘禹锡","name":"和令狐相公晚泛汉江书怀寄洋州崔侍郎阆州高舍人二曹长","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨过远山出，江澄暮霞生。\n因浮济川舟，遂作适野行。\n郊树映缇骑，水禽避红旌。\n田夫捐畚锸，织妇窥柴荆。\n古岸夏花发，遥林晚蝉清。\n沿洄方翫境，鼓角已登城。\n部内有良牧，望中寄深情。\n临觞念佳期，泛瑟动离声。\n寂寞一病士，夙昔接羣英。\n多谢谪仙侣，几时还玉京。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}